<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>

    <title>Jordan Hasgul</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.min.css"/>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1><a href="/">Jordan Hasgul</a></h1>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <h2>About me</h2>

        <p>
          Hey 👋, I'm a computer scientist and software engineer based in London, UK.
        </p>

        <p>
          Whilst my area of expertise is in building scalable and fault-tolerant distributed systems, my interests lie
          in the broader craft of software engineering. To me, it is a craft of abstraction - designing models of
          reality that extract the essence of the problem to be solved.
        </p>

        <p>
          I'll use this blog to articulate and share my opinions on software engineering (and sometimes on computer
          science).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>My posts</h2>
        <ul>
          {{- range .}}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{.Date.Format "2006-01-02"}}">{{.Date.Format "2 January 2006"}}</time>
            &mdash;
            <a href="/posts/{{.Slug}}.html">{{.Title}}</a>
          </li>
          {{- else}}
          <li>No posts yet.</li>
          {{- end}}
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>

